{"anim_count":2,"animations":[{"index":0,"preset_class":1,"preset_id":42,"preset_subtype":0,"seq_type":"STTLTimeNodeType_mainSeq","shape_id":"000382","trigger_id":"kDefaultTriggerId"},{"index":1,"preset_class":1,"preset_id":42,"preset_subtype":0,"seq_type":"STTLTimeNodeType_mainSeq","shape_id":"000389","trigger_id":"kDefaultTriggerId"}],"page_id":"00001c","page_index":19,"shape_count":5,"shapes":[{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Normal","font_size":20.0,"h":278,"id":"000382","text":"标准输入流\rSystem.in获取到的InputStream就是一个标准输入流。\r标准输入流是用来接收用户在控制台上的输入的。（普通的输入流，是获得文件或网络中的数据）\r标准输入流不需要关闭。（它是一个系统级的全局的流，JVM负责最后的关闭。）\r也可以使用BufferedReader对标准输入流进行包装。这样可以方便的接收用户在控制台上的输入。（这种方式太麻烦了，因此JDK中提供了更好用的Scanner。）\rBufferedReader br = new BufferedReader(new InputStreamReader(System.in));\rString s = br.readLine();\r当然，你也可以修改输入流的方向（System.setIn()）。让其指向文件。\r\r","type":"shape","w":755,"x":88,"y":85},{"children":[{"fill":"ED7D31","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","font_size":16.0,"h":0,"id":"000383","rot":45.0,"text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0},{"fill":"01255A","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","font_size":16.0,"h":0,"id":"000384","rot":45.0,"text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0},{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Medium","h":0,"id":"000385","text":"\r","type":"shape","w":0,"x":0,"y":0}],"h":31,"id":"000386","type":"group","w":37,"x":39,"y":24},{"fill":"none","font_name":"思源黑体 CN Bold","font_size":24.0,"h":39,"id":"000387","text":"12标准输入流&标准输出流\r\r","type":"shape","w":530,"x":85,"y":22},{"h":74,"id":"000388","img":"pptx:\\ppt\\media\\image3.png/qbb9nm","type":"picture","w":370,"x":696,"y":0},{"font_name":"思源黑体 CN Normal","font_size":20.0,"h":159,"id":"000389","text":"标准输出流\rSystem.out获取到的PrintStream就是一个标准输出流。\r标准输出流是用来向控制台上输出的。（普通的输出流，是向文件和网络等输出的。）\r标准输出流不需要关闭（它是一个系统级的全局的流，JVM负责最后的关闭。）也不需要手动刷新。\r当然，你也可以修改输出流的方向（System.setOut()）。让其指向文件。\r\r","type":"shape","w":755,"x":85,"y":339}],"version":0}
